WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:49.020
Someone once said:

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:52.890
There is meat that melts in your mouth,

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:55.360
like rose petals in full bloom,

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:59.460
with a body marbled with 
fat, and soft, red flesh...

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:02.430
Rose Meat!

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:07.800
There is an ant with a body 
shaped like a red apple,

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:10.910
with insides filled with sweet honey...

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:13.710
The Apple Ant!

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.140
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:21.520
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:26.750
Toriko and friends completely 
devoured the brand new Sweets House

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.360
that the Gourmet Architect 
Smile built for him.

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:31.830
Tina then reminded the disheartened Smile

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:36.260
that he was late in finishing the stage 
for the Gourmet King Championship!

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:40.800
When Toriko and the gang heard there 
were delicious ingredients assembled,

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.470
they headed straight to the event!

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:48.910
The Gourmet King Championship! 
Search for the Ultimate Sweets!

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:54.380
As expected from Smile-san.

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:57.620
He made this hall in no time flat!

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:00.950
But wow, everyone's so excited.

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:05.090
Oh, where's Coco-san?

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:07.990
With this crowd, I imagine 
he's going to leave soon.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.700
Coco-san!

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:14.300
Toriko?!

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:14.800
And Sunny, too!

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.230
They're the Four Heavenly Kings!

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:27.110
Oh, Tina-san!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:28.610
Thanks for coming, everyone!

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:32.750
It's finally time to start the special 
event, the Gourmet King Championship!

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:37.120
I, Tina, a Gourmet TV newscaster, 
shall be your host,

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:39.960
and we're broadcasting live 
to every country in the world!

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:44.400
First, we'll hear a word from 
the chairman of this tournament,

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:47.670
the representative of Restaurant 
Buono, Fond de Buono!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:59.380
Oh, I didn't think he'd look that young...

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.750
Restaurant Buono...

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:05.420
That's a chain restaurant with branches 
in every country in the world...

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:11.290
The CEO, Buono-san, is on the Top 
10 Gourmet Richest People list.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:15.660
He's catching up quick to the the powerful 
Gourmet family of Colonel Mokkoi.

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:21.300
So this tournament is just 
some hobby of the super rich?

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:24.330
There is only one point to this contest!

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:28.840
To bring the most delicious ingredients 
to a member of my family,

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:33.310
Chris, who has absolutely 
no appetite these days.

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:39.110
The winner will be crowned the No. 
1 Gourmet King by Restaurant Buono,

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:41.620
and given a grand prize of 1 billion yen!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:50.860
1 billion?!

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:54.360
Man, he's sure worried 
about this Chris person!

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.460
It sure is beautiful!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.170
And we also have Chris-san,

00:04:58.170 --> 00:05:03.710
who along with Buono-san, 
will judge the ingredients!

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:22.360
Seven Colored Nessie (Pterosaurian 
Beast) Capture Level 34

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:28.060
That's...

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.560
I'm sure of it... A Seven-Colored Nessie!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:33.470
It is said to be a creature 
from ancient times.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:34.940
A legendary dinosaur....

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:38.110
His family... is a wild beast?

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:39.910
Nobody told me about this!

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:41.680
The red of the soil, the 
green of the woods...

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.940
The blue of the sea, and 
the light of the stars...

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.650
Those beautiful seven colors

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.080
are proof that it is the ruler 
of the land, sea, and sky...

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:49.880
However...

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:53.690
Is something wrong?

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:58.730
Chris-san has always eaten 
together with Buono-san,

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:03.130
but lately she hasn't eaten 
a single thing, correct?

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:07.500
I am sure there is some ultimate ingredient

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.800
that Chris and I can eat 
together, out there somewhere!

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:16.980
Whoever captures that ingredient first 
will be the winner of this tournament!

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:22.920
Now then, let's introduce our participants!

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:24.780
Porktato Cutlets!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:28.990
You can only capture these in 
places with plenty of minerals!

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.320
Hold it!

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:34.730
It's a dandelion where the petals taste 
like chewy beef tongue, the Tongdelion!

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:37.630
I am the one who has captured 
such a precious ingredient,

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:40.100
and thus deserve to be crowned Gourmet King!

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:41.670
Oh, yeah?!

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.300
They both look delicious, Chris...

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:50.680
Too bad, you two.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.410
Please, bring some even 
more delicious ingredients!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:57.150
And of course, all the losing 
ingredients brought here today

00:06:57.150 --> 00:07:00.650
will be eaten up by everyone in the audience!

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:05.920
What that thing wants to eat isn't here.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:11.360
If you continue with extreme fasting 
or a diet of no carbohydrates,

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:16.370
a strong smelling substance known as 
ketone bodies are produced in the body.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.170
I can smell that from Chris.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:20.240
Smell?

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:24.910
We need to get that huge thing 
to eat a huge amount of sweets

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:29.250
and increase its sugar intake, and quick.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:33.480
Without enough sugar, its 
muscles will waste away,

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.390
and it'll have a terrible effect on the skin.

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:40.020
Gotta feed it some super 
sweet ingredient, yeah...

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.790
Sweet ingredient?

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:45.460
Yes. At this rate, it'll 
get weaker and weaker.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:46.630
Coco-san?

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:50.500
It must be fed an extremely 
sweet ingredient quickly.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:54.770
What kind of extremely sweet ingredient?

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.110
-Grand Berry!
-Honey Dragon!
-Milk Whale!

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:01.040
Hey!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.410
Each of them said a different ingredient...

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:05.850
A Grand Berry, obviously!

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:08.620
Sucking up a ton of nutrients from the earth,

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:12.790
and with the flavors of all kinds of 
berries, it's a special sweet fruit!

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:15.020
I think not! It's clearly a Milk Whale!

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.320
Milk Whale?

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:20.030
More precisely, the milk that 
comes from a Milk Whale.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:24.600
Said to be smooth as pure-white 
silk, and totally beautiful!

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:27.170
But if you really want 
something extremely sweet

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:31.210
with a ton of nutrients, can 
you do better than honey?

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:34.110
And when it comes to honey, 
the Honey Dragon...

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.840
The Grand Berry is the sweetest!

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:40.980
No! Milk has carbohydrates and lactose!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.220
Here we go again...

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.320
The electromagnetic waves are disturbed...

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:48.220
It's no wonder. A pet is part of the family.

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:49.390
Coco-san...

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:52.390
It doesn't look like the legendary fruit

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:54.230
that's related to the Seven-Colored Nessie

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:56.600
has been captured yet, given its condition.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.570
Legendary fruit?

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:03.440
A healthy Seven-Colored Nessie, 
when grown to a certain size,

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:08.580
will lead the way to a legendary 
fruit, or so they say.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.010
Really?

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:11.840
I wonder what it tastes like?

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:16.580
The sign of love rising into a red sky

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.890
invites one to the legendary fruit...

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:24.390
When ripened, the deliciousness of 
that fruit is something... special.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.990
Ooh, I want to eat it!

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:29.160
Beautiful!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:31.860
Indeed, it is a fruit that 
should be eaten by me!

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.270
Well, I'm gonna eat it first!

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.500
No, this one's mine!

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.070
It's especially beautiful, right?

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:39.840
Um... Why don't you eat it together?

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:41.070
No!

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:45.810
If you split it, the beautiful 
balance might be broken!

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.980
We don't even know how big 
it is or what it looks like!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.120
Can't promise to eat it together like this!

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:55.420
There they go again...

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:56.720
Okay then!

00:09:56.720 --> 00:10:01.790
We'll just see who gets Chris healthy 
and is led to the fruit first!

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.090
That a challenge?

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:04.830
You're on, Sunny!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:08.830
I will also go in search of an 
ingredient to get Chris healthy again.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.070
What?!

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:13.040
Which means the Heavenly Kings 
are challenging each other?

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:22.680
What's wrong, Chris?

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:25.780
Rin-san, hurry!

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:29.150
Chris?

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:31.390
Huh? Where'd everyone go?

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.590
Wait here with Kuruppo.

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:37.930
Toriko-san!

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:41.460
Hey, wait! I'll go, too!

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:50.870
Phew, made it.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.840
Bro, where's Toriko?

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.610
I have no idea where that guy is.

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:05.620
Toriko-san, where are we heading?

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:08.290
The farthest out uninhabited island.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:09.760
Mega Forest Island!

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:11.330
Mega Forest Island?

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:12.860
That's where the Grand Berry is?

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:13.730
Yup.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:17.730
The Grand Berry has a unique 
appearance, almost like a dragon.

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:20.800
The berry is a Pterosaurian Beast.

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:24.370
In other words, it's the favorite 
food of all kinds of dragons.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.540
Then that means it should also be

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:29.640
a favorite of the Seven-Colored 
Nessie too, right?

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:30.680
Yup.

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:32.750
Oh, we can see it!

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:35.450
That's Mega Forest Island!

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:58.340
Wait for me, Toriko!

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:00.810
We'll catch up in a jiffy!

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:02.210
We aren't chasing after him.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:05.950
Come on, Bro, let's head 
to where Toriko is going!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:07.980
We can still make it, you know.

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:09.880
Toriko's gonna win anyway.

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:12.350
Sorry, but I'll be the one who wins.

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:13.590
And why's that?

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:19.260
The milk of a Milk Whale is 1,000 
times fattier than any land mammal's.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:23.330
It is thick, and deeply sweet 
with a ton of nutrients.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:26.630
But Toriko and Coco's 
ingredients are sweet, too!

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:28.800
Plus, we need a ton of it.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:34.040
Only a great amount of sweet mother's milk

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:38.710
would be able to satisfy 
a dragon's huge appetite.

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:43.580
Therefore, only I am the one who can 
satisfy the Seven-Colored Nessie!

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:46.220
Then, with the leftovers,

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:50.490
we'll have ourselves a fatty milk 
bath and make our skin silky smooth!

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:51.360
Really?

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:54.230
Maybe I'm glad I came with you after all!

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:59.100
The Honey Dragon

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:02.670
is an ingredient that's been spoken about 
in ancient legends and wall paintings.

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:05.470
The Seven-Colored Nessie 
is from the same era,

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.270
so it should be easiest for it to eat.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.270
It shouldn't be much longer.

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:12.440
My fortune-telling told me 
it should appear around here.

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.830
What a pretty butterfly!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:34.970
This powder smells like a delicious spice...

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:37.740
I think I might just grab me some...

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:40.600
Komatsu!

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:43.870
Oh, Toriko-san?

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:47.410
With scales that smell like delicious 
seasoning, and a beautiful appearance,

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.010
they charm those who look at them.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:52.820
Seasonal Butterfly (Insect 
Beast) Capture Level 5

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:51.010
They're called "Seasonal Butterflies".

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:51.950
If you chase after one,

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:54.880
it'll lead you to a place where you'll 
get attacked by a fierce beast.

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.720
Keep your head on straight, Komatsu.

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:57.820
R-Right!

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:00.820
Wait, is that...?

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:05.760
I knew it!

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:12.600
Carefully...

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:15.970
Okay!

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:17.370
Rubbing Potatoes!

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:23.580
Rubbing Potato (Root) Capture Level 7

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:20.210
Rubbing potatoes are vulnerable to friction.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:22.810
If you cut them with a normal 
knife, they'll burn to a crisp.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:24.510
They're a special preparation ingredient.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:26.320
Knife!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:30.990
Here.

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.450
Thank you for the food!

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:36.090
Sweet!

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:39.790
Even though it's a potato, it's sweet 
and delicate, like cotton candy!

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:44.430
Yup. But we'll get something even 
sweeter for the Seven-Colored Nessie.

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:54.610
Hair Sensor!

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:10.890
What's he doing?

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:12.290
It's here.

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:16.430
Rin, hang on!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.420
What the...

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:40.790
It's super huge!

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:47.630
Milk Whale (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 21

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:46.090
Milk Whale...

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.890
I've come to see you.

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:49.460
Bro, you did it!

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:53.200
Bro?

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:56.300
It's not spurting out the milk we need.

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:57.840
You're right...

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:06.580
The wild boy of the sea, the Gobble Eel!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:09.180
No wonder the whale can't give any milk!

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:12.080
They're a delicate bunch.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:15.250
Even with just a little bit of 
stress, they can't put out any milk.

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.190
Why is it attacking a passive whale?

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:21.790
No...

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.530
It's a Shrimp Fly!

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:28.030
Shrimp Fly (Pterosaurian 
Beast) Capture Level 22

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:31.570
It's a Shrimp Fly and a Gobble Eel!

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:34.170
How unfortunate... What disgusting timing!

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:38.240
If you're going to eat each other, 
could you do it somewhere else?

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:39.680
Bro!

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.180
Hair Leash!

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:50.420
Fragrance Bazooka!

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:59.160
Bro, what'll we do?

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:03.200
Here it is!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:05.970
A Honey Dragon nest...

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:10.910
Honey!

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.540
Dragons get so hooked on the stuff

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:16.610
that they eat and eat 'til their 
precious fangs are full of cavities.

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:18.880
Though it's incredibly nutritious...

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.450
I sure hope this will get 
Chris healthy again...

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.990
This should be enough for years...

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:30.560
Sorry, but I'll be taking some for Chris.

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:33.900
Honey Dragon (Insect Beast) Capture Level 28

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:37.100
That poison needle...

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:39.400
If I get hit with it, the poison 
will spread in an instant,

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:41.170
breaking down and destroying my body.

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:46.580
Doesn't look like I'll be able to 
take some of that honey so easily.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:07.730
This movement... It's like it's 
been programmed in their DNA.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:09.700
Poison Dressing!

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:26.180
I hope the poisons in my body hold out 
until I can come up with antibodies...

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:31.080
This is sloping up, right?

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:32.790
Be careful, Komatsu!

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:34.590
That's no normal chestnut!

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:39.060
Chestnutmadillo (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 21

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:42.800
Take a look!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:48.700
Gourmet Hunters are lining up, thinking 
this could be the ingredient!

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:51.700
But Chris-san has not 
eaten even a single gram!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.870
You could at least have a bite...

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:57.240
Come on, this ingredient is pretty good!

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:05.820
Chris... I always shared my food with you.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:11.520
But I know that you realize 
not eating food is a waste...

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:13.230
So why, all of a sudden?

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:20.000
It's me! Take a look!

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:21.070
Tonma?

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:21.900
Zonge!

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:23.070
Remember, already!

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:24.970
What's with the outfit?

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:27.710
You look wonderful, Zonge-sama!

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:29.340
Lose a bet or something?

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:32.410
Even so, you wouldn't normally go this far...

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:35.080
It's an RPG!

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.950
Dragons love to capture princesses, right?

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:40.950
So I'm dressed up like a princess!

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:44.160
And the ingredient?

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.560
Miracle Drops?

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:50.930
Miracle Drops (Sweetener) Capture Level 1

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.090
Oh, you know these?

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:49.890
The tastes of the drops change 
each time you shake them!

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:51.030
See?

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:53.160
Quite confident, you are.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:57.270
Ooh, it's looking at me!

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:02.810
Zonge-sama!

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:10.150
Why, you...

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:11.780
It just ate me!

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:14.520
I am the Gourmet King! The billion is mine!

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:17.090
Zonge-sama, you were right on the money!

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.560
Can we move on?

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.590
I'll explain to him later.

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:24.630
T-T-Toriko-san!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:28.900
The only thing I'm after is a Grand Berry!

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:59.460
T-Toriko-san!

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:08.970
Toriko-san, look!

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:11.010
We found the Grand Berry!

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:14.580
Grand Berry... It really 
does look like a dragon.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:32.090
Sabrina

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.300
Pa-pa-pa-para

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:37.160
Sabrina

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:46.240
Rainy day, danced down on the night city

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:53.150
You had deep red lipstick on you

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:56.920
Like you were toyed with

00:21:56.920 --> 00:22:00.350
Like you were tasted

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:07.460
A solitary silhouette seen through the glass

00:22:07.460 --> 00:22:14.200
One day, one day... Search for true love

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:21.270
Even if hurt by the lies going around town

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:26.010
Rottening fruit

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:27.580
Sabrina

00:22:30.680 --> 00:22:32.520
Gourmet News!

00:22:32.820 --> 00:22:34.250
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:34.550 --> 00:22:37.160
Thank you so much for your support of

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:40.830
the Toriko Anime's Original Monster Contest!

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:44.030
Here are the monsters that 
appeared in today's episode:

00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:46.160
Rose Meat, Apple Ant, Seven-Colored 
Nessie, Porktato Cutlets,

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:47.530
Tongdelion, Seasonal 
Butterfly, Rubbing Potato,

00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:49.770
Milk Whale, Gobble Eel, 
Shrimp Fly, Honey Dragon,

00:22:49.770 --> 00:22:52.470
Giant Treasure, Peachy Peach, 
Chestnutmadillo, Miracle Drops...

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:54.470
There, I said them all!

00:22:58.510 --> 00:23:03.350
I'll be looking forward to all your 
original ingredients next week!

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:05.050
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:10.550
The Gourmet King championship is really heating up!

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:13.560
What is the ultimate ingredient that Chris is seeking?

00:23:13.980 --> 00:23:16.930
Bonding Dish! Partners Are Forever!

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:18.990
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
